    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Hazelcast Operations & Reliability\n\nReliability dashboard for Simulator AP workloads. It tracks operation queues, pending invocations, timeout counters, failed backups, executor queues, event queues, and TCP write pressure.\n\n**Key questions this dashboard answers:**\n- Are operations queued or running longer than expected?\n- Are invocations pending, retrying, or timing out?\n- Are backup failures or backup timeouts appearing during failover?\n- Are executors, event queues, or TCP write queues backing up?\n\n**Simulator context:** during member/DC failover, short spikes are expected; persistent non-zero values after recovery indicate instability."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Operation Pressure",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pending Invocations",
      "description": "Current pending invocations across selected members.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_operation_invocations_pending{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", mc_member=~\"$member\"})",
          "legendFormat": "pending",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
